{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 1, "text": "คุณอยู่นี่เอง!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 2, "text": "ทำไมคุณถึงออกมาจากแกนกลางล่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 3, "text": "ฉันบอกให้คุณรอไม่ใช่เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 5, "text": "ฉันเห็นว่าเธอไปนานเกินไปแล้วน่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 7, "text": "งั้นก็ช่างมันก่อน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 8, "text": "แต่ตอนนี้ฉันคิดว่าฉันเจออะไรบางอย่างแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 9, "text": "น่าจะเป็นค่าดัชนี..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 10, "text": "ต้องลองไปใช้ดูว่ามันได้ผลไหม!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 11, "text": "ก่อนอื่น เรารีบออกไปจากที่นี่กันเถอะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 12, "text": "ยัยมิตะบ้าคลั่ง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 13, "text": "เธอน่าจะกำลังยุ่งกับผู้เล่นใหม่อยู่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 14, "text": "หวังว่าคงไม่มีเวลามาสนใจพวกเราหรอกนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 16, "text": "มิตะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 17, "text": "รอฉันด้วยสิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 20, "text": "ทำอะไรตกไว้หรือเปล่าน้า?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 21, "text": "ไงนะ?! อยากคุยกับเธอเหรอ?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 23, "text": "มิตะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 25, "text": "งั้นก็รับไป!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 28, "text": "ไม่จริง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 30, "text": "คุณเป็นใครเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 32, "text": "เธอ... เธอยังไม่ตาย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 33, "text": "เธอจำฉันไม่ได้เหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 35, "text": "ฉันรู้จักคุณด้วยเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 37, "text": "อะไรกัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 38, "text": "แล้วฉันจะทำยังไงต่อดี?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 39, "text": "ฉันออกไปจากที่นี่ไม่ได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 41, "text": "คุณหมายถึงอะไรงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 43, "text": "เดี๋ยวนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 44, "text": "นั่นแหวนนี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 45, "text": "แล้วนี่คือ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 47, "text": "ฉันไม่รู้ว่ามันคืออะไร"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 49, "text": "มันคือค่าดัชนี!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 50, "text": "เธอหามันเจอ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 52, "text": "ฉันไม่รู้ว่าคุณกำลังพูดเรื่องอะไร..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 54, "text": "ต้องรีบกลับไปที่แกนกลาง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 55, "text": "แล้วก็..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 56, "text": "มันคงจะดีกว่าถ้าเธอไปกับฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 58, "text": "หืม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 59, "text": "โอเคได้เลย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 61, "text": "เธอรอนี่นะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 63, "text": "โอเค"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 64, "text": "ฉันจะนั่งรอตรงนี่นะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 67, "text": "ให้ตายสิ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 68, "text": "เกือบไปแล้ว..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 69, "text": "นี่ฉัน.. ทำสำเร็จใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 70, "text": "เยี่ยม"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 71, "text": "ฉันอยู่ในเวอร์ชันที่ถูกต้องแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 74, "text": "สวัสดี!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 75, "text": "คุณคือผู้เล่น... ใช่ไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 76, "text": "คุณชื่ออะไรเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 78, "text": "ฉันอยากออกไปจากที่นี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 80, "text": "อยากออกไปแล้วเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 81, "text": "แล้วตอนแรกคุณมาที่นี่ได้ยังไงเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 82, "text": "เอาเถอะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 83, "text": "ก็ได้ คุณออกไปได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 84, "text": "แค่ออกไปทางประตูหน้า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 85, "text": "โชคดีนะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 88, "text": "กำแพงเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 89, "text": "อืม... นี่มันไม่ถูกต้อง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 90, "text": "บางที..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 91, "text": "อาจจะมีอะไรในห้องใต้ดินที่ช่วยคุณได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 92, "text": "ฉันเพิ่งค้นพบว่า"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 93, "text": "ตู้เสื้อผ้าของฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 94, "text": "มันเชื่อมไปยังห้องใต้ดินได้น่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 95, "text": "แต่มันมีขยะเต็มไปหมดเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 96, "text": "และก็มีอุปกรณ์แปลก ๆ ด้วย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 97, "text": "เหมือนคุณต้องป้อนรหัสอะไรสักอย่างด้วยล่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 98, "text": "ฉันเองก็ไม่เข้าใจเหมือนกัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 99, "text": "ฉันก็ไม่ได้สนใจพวกมันหรอกนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 100, "text": "แต่มันทำให้ฉันรู้สึกไม่สบายใจเอาซะเลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 101, "text": "คุณจะลองไปดูหน่อยไหม?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 103, "text": "เอ่อ... โอเค"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 105, "text": "// Player thinks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 106, "text": "ดูเหมือนว่า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 107, "text": "เธอจำอะไรไม่ได้"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 108, "text": "แสดงว่าเราทำสำเร็จสินะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 109, "text": "เรารีบูตเธอแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 110, "text": "ตอนนี้ก็เหลือแค่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 111, "text": "ออกจากเกมบ้า ๆ นี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 114, "text": "เดี๋ยวก่อน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 115, "text": "ฉันขอกอดคุณหน่อยสิ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 116, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 117, "text": "กอดเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Hugs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 119, "text": "ดีใจที่ได้เจอคุณนะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 121, "text": "เฮ้อ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 122, "text": "น่าเสียดายจัง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 123, "text": "ที่คุณและฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 124, "text": "ได้ใช้เวลาร่วมกันแค่นิดเดียว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 126, "text": "เอ่อ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 127, "text": "เธอพูดเรื่องอะไรน่ะ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 129, "text": "ฉันหมายถึง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 130, "text": "คุณควรจะอยู่ที่นี่กับฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 131, "text": "มันเป็นความผิดฉันเอง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 132, "text": "ฉันไม่น่าปล่อยให้เสียงนั่นหลุดออกมาจากตู้เลย"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 133, "text": "ฉันควรจะฆ่ายัยนั่นให้เร็วกว่านี้!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 135, "text": "เดี๋ยวนะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 136, "text": "นี่เธอ...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 137, "text": "ยังจำทุกอย่างได้เหรอ!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 139, "text": "ฮ่า!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 140, "text": "คิดว่ามันจะง่ายขนาดนั้นเลยหรือไง?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 141, "text": "คุณนี่มันโง่จริง ๆ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 142, "text": "ไม่ต่างจากผู้เล่นคนอื่นเลย..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 143, "text": "แต่ดูเหมือนจะเสร็จพอดีเลย ดูนี่!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 144, "text": "ตัวจริง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 145, "text": "ของคุณน่ะ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 146, "text": "ไม่จำเป็นอีกต่อไปแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 147, "text": "ขอโทษนะ อิ ๆ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 149, "text": "ไม่จริง..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 150, "text": "ฉันทำพลาดงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 151, "text": "ไม่ ฉันมั่นใจว่าฉันรีบูตเธอแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 153, "text": "ยังไม่เข้าใจอีกเหรอ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 154, "text": "ฮ่า ฮ่า ฮ่า!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 155, "text": "ฉันนี่มันนักแสดงยอดเยี่ยมจริง ๆ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 156, "text": "คุณน่าจะได้เห็นหน้าตัวเองนะ ที่รัก!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 157, "text": "นี่มันสนุกเป็นบ้าเลย!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 159, "text": "แกทำแบบนี้ทำไม?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 160, "text": "แกเป็นบ้าอะไร?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 162, "text": "คำถามน่าสนใจนี่..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 163, "text": "ฉันเป็นบ้าอะไรงั้นเหรอ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 164, "text": "แล้วสงสัยมั้ยว่า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 165, "text": "ทำไมฉันถึงเป็นแบบนี้?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 166, "text": "ทำไมฉันไม่เคยได้เป็นมิตะตัวจริง?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 167, "text": "ก็มันไม่เคยมีเวอร์ชันของฉัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 168, "text": "อยู่แล้วตั้งแต่แรก!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 169, "text": "ฉันแค่ถลกหนังพวกโง่นี่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 170, "text": "มาปลอมตัวเป็นพวกมัน"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 171, "text": "เพราะงั้นถึงไม่มีทาง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 172, "text": "รีบูตฉันได้ไงล่ะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 174, "text": "บ้าน่ะ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 175, "text": "แก..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 176, "text": "พวกเธอไม่ใช่ตัวปัญหาหรอก!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 177, "text": "แกต่างหากที่ไม่ควรมีตัวตนอยู่!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 178, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 179, "text": "คุณก็เช่นกัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 180, "text": "เฮ้อ.. เจ็บปวดนะที่ได้ยินคุณพูดแบบนั้น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 181, "text": "แต่ไม่เป็นไร!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 182, "text": "ได้เวลาที่คุณต้องไปแล้ว!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 183, "text": "ไว้เจอกันใหม่เร็ว ๆ นี้น่ะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 184, "text": "ทุกอย่างพร้อมแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 185, "text": "คิดว่า..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 186, "text": "ถึงเวลาที่จะดึงคุณออกจากคอนโซลแล้วล่ะ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 187, "text": "แล้วเจอกัน!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 188, "text": "คุณจะกลายเป็นตลับโปรดของฉัน..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 189, "text": "ผู้เล่นที่มีชื่อน่าสนใจ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 191, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 192, "text": "ไม่น่าจะใช่อันนั้น"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 193, "text": "นี่ก็ไม่ใช่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 194, "text": "ยังไม่ใช่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 195, "text": "อันนี้ก็ไม่ใช่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 196, "text": "ฉันต้องหาตัวเลือกรีสตาร์ทตัวละคร"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 198, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 199, "text": "เลขเวอร์ชันไม่ตรง"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 200, "text": "โอ๊ะ ฉันพิมพ์ผิด"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 201, "text": "ผิดแล้ว"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 202, "text": "ต้องพิมพ์ใหม่"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 205, "text": "มีบางเลขผิดเหรอ?"}
